Revision history for Perl extension Text::UnicodeStyle

0.01  2026-11-16
    - Initial release
    - Text::UnicodeStyle module with stylize() and styles() API
    - 19 styles: bold, bold_fraktur, bold_italic, bold_script,
      circled, doublestruck, fraktur, fullwidth, italic, monospace,
      negative_circled, negative_squared, parenthesized, sans_serif,
      sans_serif_bold, sans_serif_bold_italic, sans_serif_italic,
      script, squared
    - Digit substitution in styles that define it
    - Fullwidth punctuation mapping
    - substitute-letters CLI script (--style, --list, --help)
